#: ../../tools/cryoet_tools.rst:32 3cdd43b9f2bf47c4a66078a14b7dcdd7
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get full metadata for a specific CryoET Data Portal "
"dataset by its numeric ID. Returns complete dataset information including"
" organism taxonomy, tissue/cell identifiers, sample preparation details, "
"publication references, data access paths (S3 and HTTPS), and file size. "
"Use this after \\`CryoET\\_list\\_datasets\\` to retrieve detailed "
"information for a specific dataset. The dataset ID is an integer (e.g. "
"10053, 10174)."
msgstr ""

